{"id":"37939714e9b947f30a7da7b8ca17601f0489b8c3","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1241617","title":"2026 年还有使用古法编程的兄弟吗？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"esile","excerpt":"古法编程 - @esile - 分享一下你坚持传统古法拒绝 ai 辅助的原因","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/古法\"><li></li> 古法</a><a href=\"/tag/编程\"><li></li> 编程</a><a href=\"/tag/原因\"><li></li> 原因</a></P><p><span>12 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-13 21:33:16 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18079017\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7378fe3ab0f9395a7fb6774621b0b609?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"RightHand\" data-uid=\"476423\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/RightHand\">RightHand</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-13 07:16:12 +08:00\">20h 46m ago via Android</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>开源库，基础类库，工具库，古法编程。ai 协助写测试。寻找不合理/可优化的地方，但不让 ai 写代码。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18079053\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/91e5/1471/637573_normal.png?m=1746043098\" alt=\"passive\" data-uid=\"637573\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/passive\">passive</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-13 08:37:44 +08:00\">19h 24m ago via Android</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>AI 没法“懂”数学和物理，生成看似正确的计算步骤，结果也收敛，但是就是有百分之几的系统误差，拉锯无数轮也找不出 bug ，只能古法编程。其他只需要仓鼠用体力蹬出来的确实可以 AI 。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18079064\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7aee/26c3/2719_normal.png?m=1783137169\" alt=\"loading\" data-uid=\"2719\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/loading\">loading</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-13 08:48:03 +08:00\">19h 14m ago via Android</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <div><p>不可能拒绝 ai 辅助，查一下语法和算法思路也叫辅助，特别是出错后查语，问 ai 可比用搜索引擎方便多了。</p><p>我拒绝的是 ai 直接写完，review 也是完全给 ai 一眼不看的那种。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18079072\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5cbf/296d/186159_normal.png?m=1702003730\" alt=\"lifei6671\" data-uid=\"186159\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lifei6671\">lifei6671</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-13 08:55:10 +08:00\">19h 7m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我发现 AI 写的代码比我好。唯一缺的是对业务的过度理解。所以，业务代码我来写，或者让 AI 辅助小范围写。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18079092\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/339f45b8b0538c27a0e29cc829bfa55c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"bobox\" data-uid=\"759572\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/bobox\">bobox</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-13 09:14:53 +08:00\">18h 47m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>AI 写，再换个 AI review ，出报告，人看报告就行了，让机器之间互相卷，互相斗去吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18079186\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/db4b/6620/538245_normal.png?m=1783296203\" alt=\"tianhehechu\" data-uid=\"538245\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/tianhehechu\">tianhehechu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-13 10:21:38 +08:00\">17h 40m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>自己的项目全让 AI 完成，工作大部分还是自己写。古法编程，老师傅手稳。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18079222\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2803aebc6b39ed4ea3140a28febf01a5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"frankies\" data-uid=\"556542\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/frankies\">frankies</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-13 10:45:49 +08:00\">17h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>swift 强依赖原生开发，AI 写得时好时坏，还是需要古法打配合。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18079492\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n           